{
  "id": "s1-04",
  "seasonId": "season-1",
  "episodeNumber": 4,
  "title": {
    "en": "The Happy Roswaal Mansion Family"
  },
  "airDate": "2016-04-24",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "That was close, I made it in time. This week is episode 4, thanks in advance! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724267867890307072",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "It's started! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724267936194519040",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The basics of waking up. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724267997792083969",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "It feels like you could get sucked into the far end of the hallway. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724268084689694720",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "\"What an infuriating person you are from the bottom of my heart.\" ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724268266193965057",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "As for the forbidden library, after having them make detailed settings for it, it ended up being built on a scale that exceeded even the original author's expectations. It certainly adds prestige to the position of librarian. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724268553390563329",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Seeing them appear one by one like this really makes it feel like a new arc! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724268966621777920",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "That sponsor card is so shamelessly cute. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724269003540029440",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "A Part begins! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724269254783045632",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Repeating the same gag is the basics. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724269327503921154",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "The sisters are here~  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724269484819668992",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Setting it up like this was a great call by me!  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724269616055222272",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "If you pay attention to Emilia's neckline, you can see the anime's delicate attention to detail.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724269840161087492",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "Short legs  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724269878421516288",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "Emilia-tan's first radio calisthenics  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724269941331906560",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "This is in respect to Drill Sergeant Billy.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724269996864458752",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "Seen from a distance, the mansion is big enough to look like a castle. Makes you appreciate Rem's hard work.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724270147221917697",
      "characters": [
        "Rem"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "Puck here is ridiculously cute  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724270200565039106",
      "characters": [
        "Puck"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "Subaru and Puck getting along so well is ridiculously good  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724270323265212416",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru",
        "Puck"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "The loli's attitude changes so blatantly  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724270453443858432",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "That shocked me  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724270513468530688",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "It's him.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724270558066544640",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "Only the name is said in a seriously intense voice  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724270709065703424",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "text": "Originally, they were using much more of the table here, but Subaru moves his own chair over and comes to sit next to Emilia.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724270839550468096",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia",
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "text": "As for Koyasu-san, who plays Roswaal, we didn't give him any particular acting directions. He matches the character perfectly just from the script. As expected, incredible.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724271116915634176",
      "characters": [
        "Roswaal L. Mathers"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "text": "Beatrice and Puck have absolutely no interest in the conversation  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724271211954348033",
      "characters": [
        "Beatrice",
        "Puck"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "text": "Roswaal-san steals the show with every line, but the dining hall is full of heroines, after all. Don't just be captivated by Roswaal!　",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724271582906982406",
      "characters": [
        "Roswaal L. Mathers"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "text": "Ah-choo  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724271635272859649",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "text": "Nee-sama's downer, languid vibe is really great, isn't it...  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724271830119272448",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "text": "Part B starts! Time flies today too!  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724271990014517248",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "text": "Barusu!!  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724272079768412160",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "text": "If you take a good look around this wardrobe room too, it's basically full of Roswaal's outfits (lol)  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724272241945407492",
      "characters": [
        "Roswaal L. Mathers"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "text": "\"Hyan!\"  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724272435550285828",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "text": "Fast-forwarding  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724272671622455296",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "text": "Nee-sama actually does work, you know  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724272735765942272",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "text": "A jacket over a tracksuit, that's not actually bad, right?  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724272886911897600",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "text": "I'm good at straight stitching and stuff  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724272958705819649",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "text": "Favoritism. Rem loves her older sister. Her older sister loves Rem too.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724273041245523968",
      "characters": [
        "Rem"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "text": "Hah!  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724273079233314816",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "text": "The kitchen knife even has a name engraved on it...!  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724273161819152388",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "text": "A secret meeting under the moon (ominous implications)  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724273247202627584",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "text": "The kids' side  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724273413318045696",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "text": "This Emilia-tan has twin tails. Asymmetrical twin tails.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724273498005237760",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "text": "\"The moon is beautiful, isn't it?\" \"It's up somewhere out of reach, after all.\"  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724273593270435841",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "text": "What you truly want in that very moment. You could call it fleeting, or simply materialistic.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724273719292485633",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "text": "Scam a pile of money and live it up -> completely off-base flag  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724273823051177984",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "text": "First E.M.T.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724274023236947968",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "text": "Emilia-tan is unbelievably cute around here, so if you recorded it, go back and watch it again. Emilia-tan among the flower petals is ridiculously cute.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724274190925193217",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "text": "\"It'd be embarrassing if my friends saw...\"  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724274244247408641",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "text": "Ending inserted  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724274335259586560",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "text": "This one was a Roswaal episode, wasn't it...  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724274426389254146",
      "characters": [
        "Roswaal L. Mathers"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "text": "That would be heaven in its own way too  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724274548925849600",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "text": "It's a hopeful morning!  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724274624117137412",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "text": "Part B finished!!  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724274764307529728",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "text": "It really was a hopeful morning.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724274816589520896",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "text": "So this time they put the sponsor card over the eyes...  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724275057954934784",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "text": "It's a hopeful morning. If you wake up, something may have changed. There is hope in being able to confirm despair.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724275210417926145",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "text": "The warm family time at Roswaal's mansion really lived up to the episode title. Since Episodes 1 through 3 were packed and hectic, this was a heartwarming episode made with a lot of care to properly deliver the \"life in another world\" part of the title.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724275574256979968",
      "characters": [
        "Roswaal L. Mathers"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "text": "Even so, every single time, one episode goes by so fast. Time flies. It's such a fulfilling time that I can't even say everything I want to say.  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724275808257204226",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "text": "Phew, satisfied. Thanks for joining me again this week. Chapter 2 is, compared to Chapter 1, well, how do I put it, it gets pretty rough in a lot of ways, but I hope you'll keep supporting us! Have good dreams! So you can greet a hopeful morning!  ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/724276482516766720",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    }
  ]
}
